<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
        }

        .container {
            width: 80%;
            margin: 20px auto;
            border: 1px solid #eee;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .header {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #555;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .footer {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #777;
            margin-top: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .button {
            background: #000;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .steps {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 16px 0;
        }

        .steps ol {
            margin: 8px 0 0 0;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h2>{{#if (eq requestType 'purchase')}}You missed a purchase request{{else}}You missed a rental request{{/if}}</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello {{listerName}},</p>
            <p><strong>{{renterName}}</strong> wanted to {{#if (eq requestType 'purchase')}}buy{{else}}rent{{/if}} <strong>{{productName}}</strong>, but the request expired before you responded.</p>
            <p>If you still want to {{#if (eq requestType 'purchase')}}sell{{else}}rent out{{/if}} this item, open the request and tell them you are available.</p>
            <div class="steps">
                <strong>How to notify them</strong>
                <ol>
                    <li>Open the request using the button below.</li>
                    <li>Use <strong>Notify renter item is available</strong> on the request.</li>
                    <li>They can then send a new request and you can approve.</li>
                </ol>
            </div>
            <p><a href="{{orderLink}}" class="button">View request</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} Relisted. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>
